{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f98efa0ea99ae261ffac112af37d88d1.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f98efa0ea99ae261ffac112af37d88d1.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f98efa0ea99ae261ffac112af37d88d1.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a bleak future where the world\u2019s population is on the brink of collapse, you play as <strong>Dream, </strong>the only<strong> Perfect Companion Robot</strong> ever built; designed to be the ideal partner. You must avoid the grip of the <strong>Starlets</strong> who seek to claim you as their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your permanent power supply has been broken and split into 8 pieces that you need to retrieve or else you will run out of power within the year. Each piece that you gather will bring you closer to understanding what you really are.<br><br>Explore the stages and find your <strong>armor sets and upgrades</strong> for your<strong> health and power-ups</strong>. Uncover <strong>secret routes</strong> and collect your parts so that you can continue to survive and escape your would-be captors, as well as learn a bit more about your <strong>potential partner!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/bedfe50087c6be592b21532da2347c72.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=720 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/bedfe50087c6be592b21532da2347c72.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/bedfe50087c6be592b21532da2347c72.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the futuristic world of <strong>Radiant Starlets</strong>, an HD2D style action-platformer in the vein of classic Mega Man games but you can date all the bosses!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/cde004493024ccf79f830f769db818d8.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/cde004493024ccf79f830f769db818d8.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/cde004493024ccf79f830f769db818d8.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, dash, and dodge</strong> your way through 8 action-packed stages and escape the clutches of those who would possess you for themselves. Your <strong>skills, timing, and agility</strong> are the key to your success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/43d525e1cd8d0496b66f7267212ad084.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/43d525e1cd8d0496b66f7267212ad084.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/43d525e1cd8d0496b66f7267212ad084.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiant Starlets is designed with replayability in mind. Each playthrough with a different <strong>romantic partner </strong>will have you unlock <strong>new minigames armor sets,</strong> and a <strong>unique ending.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/2fcd27fa24a1fbba198efa832309f69c.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/2fcd27fa24a1fbba198efa832309f69c.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/2fcd27fa24a1fbba198efa832309f69c.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse Challenging Environments: </strong>Play 8 main stages and face against <strong>Starlet Overdrive,</strong> a world-famous S-Pop group bent on obtaining Dream for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/990af5e491d59bc2f7557c86bd49c73b.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/990af5e491d59bc2f7557c86bd49c73b.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/990af5e491d59bc2f7557c86bd49c73b.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per-Relationship Speed-runs:</strong> Each partner provides a separate speed run and endings. With Radiant Starlets, you're encouraged to try every boss order. Replay to experience each partner\u2019s armor set, minigame, and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f5e75318b1124e9474d7a443a76b289f.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f5e75318b1124e9474d7a443a76b289f.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f5e75318b1124e9474d7a443a76b289f.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Partner Specific Mini Games: </strong>Each partner has a custom mini game, designed to unlock partner-specific power-ups and narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/ecc8041d0ca799fd2a66440260412e2c.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/ecc8041d0ca799fd2a66440260412e2c.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/ecc8041d0ca799fd2a66440260412e2c.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor Designed by your Partner:</strong> Each partner playthrough will have a custom armor set with unique properties, creating variances in gameplay between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get power ups from each boss: </strong>The Starlets have all modified Dream's power source to power their equipment. When he retrieves them he will get a part of their powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endings for Each Romantic Partner: </strong>Each Romantic partner provides narrative changes and their own distinct ending.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986230?t=1756922126","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/aafecd8aa80c75eefb2b04f2f93d5d6e3b3f3383/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756922126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/7fc155bdf68824697dd70a3b098130ef7517d75f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756922126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/7fc155bdf68824697dd70a3b098130ef7517d75f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756922126","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f98efa0ea99ae261ffac112af37d88d1.poster.avif?t=1756922126\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f98efa0ea99ae261ffac112af37d88d1.webm?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986230/extras/f98efa0ea99ae261ffac112af37d88d1.mp4?t=1756922126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><